## GenAI Migration: providers/embeddings.py

> **Date:** 2026-01-08
> **Status:** ✅ Complete

Extended [DualEngineLLM](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/llm_client.py#13-212) adapter to support embeddings and refactored vector generation.

### Key Implementation Details

1.  **Adapter Extension:** Added [embed_content](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/llm_client.py#157-208) method to [DualEngineLLM](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/llm_client.py#13-212) (lines 157-205 of [llm_client.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/llm_client.py)).
    -   Supports `task_type` (retrieval_document, retrieval_query).
    -   Normalizes output to `{'embedding': [floats]}` format for compatibility.
2.  **Provider Refactor:** Updated [generate_embedding](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/providers/embeddings.py#29-75) and [generate_query_embedding](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/providers/embeddings.py#77-113) in [providers/embeddings.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/providers/embeddings.py) to use [DualEngineLLM](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/llm_client.py#13-212).
3.  **Fallback:** Retained legacy `genai.embed_content` fallback if adapter import fails.
4.  **Verification:** Both adapter and provider tests passed (768-dim embeddings generated).

